<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Status-bar notification icon for the study reminder.

  Android requires this to be a flat, single-color alpha mask (any
  non-transparent pixel is drawn as solid white/tinted by the OS) — the
  launcher icon (which is a full-color adaptive icon) is not a valid
  substitute and silently fails to render correctly in the status bar on
  many OEM skins. This is the logo reduced to a silhouette: the torii inside
  the open ensō ring.
-->
